<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="COL" style="id" />
  <para style="h">JO KOLOCAI</para>
  <para style="toc1">Waraga ma Paulo ocoyo bot Jo Kolocai</para>
  <para style="toc2">Jo Kolocai</para>
  <para style="toc3">Kol</para>
  <para style="mt2">Waraga ma Paulo ocoyo bot</para>
  <para style="mt1">JO KOLOCAI</para>
  <para style="imt">Lanyut wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="ip">Paulo ocoyo waraga man bot jo Kolocai, ma nonge i Acia tung kunyango me Epeco. Paulo pe ocako kanica man, ento onongo tye ite adwol ma en Paulo tye iye ki twero. En obedo kacwalo lutic ma a ki Epeco kunu. Epeco kono obedo taun madit ma jo Roma giloyo ma onongo nonge i Acia. Paulo onongo dong otyeko niang woko ni lupwonye ma lugoba dong gudonyo woko i kanica matye i Kolocai kun gipwonyo dano ni kace dano mo mito ngeyo Lubanga maber ki me jolo lar omyero kong ocak ki woro luker ki wegi twero mogo pa jogi. Medo ikom meno, lupwonye magi bene gipwonyo ni, dano gubed katimo kit kwer mogo calo lire ki bene gulub cik ma mako gin acama ki jami mogo mapatpat mapol ata.</para>
  <para style="ip">Paulo ocoyo waraga man me kwero lakit pwony magi woko kun tito kamaleng pwony me ada ma lukricitayo omyero gulubi. Pen pwony man tye ni lar kikome a ki bot Yecu Kricito ento kit kwer mukeneni ducu rwenyo dano arweny ki bot Yecu. Lubanga ocweyo lobo ducu kun wok ki i Yecu dok kombedi bene en tye kadwoko jami ducu cen bote kun bene wok ki i Yecu. Gen me lar pi lobo bene tye i Yecu keken. Paulo bene onyutu kamaleng pwony ducu ma mako kwo pa jo ma oye Yecu.</para>
  <para style="ip">I waraga man waneno bene ni Tukiko, ma Paulo ooro me tero waraga man owoto kacel gin ki Onesimo, ma obedo opii ma Paulo ocoyo waraga pire bot Pilemon.</para>
  <para style="iot">Lacim wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="io1">Lanyut <char style="ior"><ref loc="COL 1:1-8">1:1-8</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kit pa Kricito ki tice <char style="ior"><ref loc="COL 1:9-2:19">1:9—2:19</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kwo manyen i Kricito <char style="ior"><ref loc="COL 2:20-4:6">2:20—4:6</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ladol <char style="ior"><ref loc="COL 4:7-18">4:7-18</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="COL 1" />
  <para style="s1">Mot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 1:1" />Waraga man oa ki bot an Paulo ma lakwena pa Yecu Kricito pi mit pa Lubanga, ki bot ominwa Temceo.<verse eid="COL 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 1:2" />Bot jo pa Lubanga ki utmego ma gene i Kolocai, ma gitye i Kricito: Lubanga Wonwa omiwu kica ki kuc.<verse eid="COL 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lega me pwoc</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 1:3" />Wapwoyo Lubanga Won Rwotwa Yecu Kricito kare ducu ma walego pirwu. <verse eid="COL 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 1:4" />Wan dong wawinyo pi niyewu ikom Kricito Yecu ki pi marwu ma wumaro kwede jo pa Lubanga ducu. <verse eid="COL 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 1:5" />Meno ducu obino pi gin ma wugeno ma kikano i polo pirwu, mayam dong wuwinyo pire con i lok me ada, ma en aye lok me Kwena Maber <verse eid="COL 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 1:6" />ma obino botwu. Tye bene kanyako nyige kun nya iwi lobo ducu ikit yo acelu, macalo tye katime botwu, cake inino ma wuwinyo iye, ka dong oweko wuniang i kica pa Lubanga i ada. <verse eid="COL 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 1:7" />Epapira ma en latic pa Kricito pirwa ma gene ma en latic wadiwa ma wamaro opwonyowu kwede. <verse eid="COL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 1:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:12">Kol 4:12</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:23">Pile 23</ref> </char></note> En bene ma otitiwa pi mar ma wutye kwede i Cwiny Maleng.<verse eid="COL 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 1:9" />Cake inino ma wawinyo pirwu, walego Lubanga ma pe wakeng, kun walego ni omyero dok wuniang matut i gin ma en mito, kun wubedo ki ryeko ki niang ducu ma Cwiny Maleng miyo. <verse eid="COL 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 1:10" />Wek kwowu obed ma myero bot Rwot, ma yomo cwinye maber, kun wutiyo tic mabeco mamiyo kwowu nyak nyig madwong, dok wumede bene kangeyo Lubanga. <verse eid="COL 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 1:11" />Walegoni Lubanga omiwu tek ducu ma a ki i twero me deyone, wek wucir can ducu kun wudiyo cwinywu i yo ducu ki yomcwiny. <verse eid="COL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 1:12" />Walegoni wubimiyo pwoc bot Lubanga Won ma omiyowa twer me nywako kacel ki jone maleng jami ducu ma en bimiyo botgi i ker ma mere i lengpiny. <verse eid="COL 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 1:13" />En ceng olarowa ki ite loc me piny macol ci okobowa woko ite loc pa Wode ma en maro. <verse eid="COL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 1:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 1:7">Epe 1:7</ref> </char></note> Koko dano, ma en aye weko bal, a ki bote.<verse eid="COL 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kricito en lawi jami ducu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 1:15" />Kricito obedo cal pa Lubanga ma pe nen ni, latin kayo ki ikin ginacweya ducu ma Lubanga ocweyo. <verse eid="COL 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 1:16" />Pien i en Lubanga ocweyo jami ducu, gin matye i polo ki gin matye iwi lobo, gin manen ki gin ma pe nen, kadi wa wegi komker ki wegi dito, ki luloc, ki wegi twer ducu. Jami ducu yam kicweyo pi twere dok pire bene. <verse eid="COL 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 1:17" />En aye mukwongo kati atii ki jami ducu, dok bene i en jami ducu ribe kacel. <verse eid="COL 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 1:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:22-23">1:22-23</ref> </char></note>En aye wic, ki jo ma oye en gubedo kome. En obedo acaki, en mukwongo cer ki ikin jo ma oto, wek etel yo ikin jami ducu. <verse eid="COL 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 1:19" />Pien Lubanga oye bedo i en ikit yo ducu ma en tye kwede. <verse eid="COL 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 1:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:16">Epe 2:16</ref> </char></note> Lubanga bene oye me dwoko jami ducu bote i Kricito, gin matye iwi lobo ki gin matye i polo, kun Kricito okelo kuc pi remo me tone ikom yatariya.<verse eid="COL 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 1:21" />Wun yam wupoke woko ki Lubanga; onongo wubedo lukwore i tamwu, kun wutimo gin maracu. <verse eid="COL 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 1:22" />Ento kombedi dong pi to pa Wode mayam odoko dano, en odwokowu woko bote, wek ekelwu inyime ma nongo wutye maleng, dok bene ma wutye labongo bal mo, ma lok mo marac pe ikomwu. <verse eid="COL 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 1:23" />Wumede me bedo ki niye, kun wucung matek, dok wumoko woko liking ma pe wulenge ki i gen me lok me Kwena Maber madong wuwinyo, ma gitito bot ginacweya ducu matye ite polo, dok bene an Paulo kikoma yam adoko latic pire.<verse eid="COL 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tic pa Paulo bot jo ma oye Kricito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 1:24" />Kombedi an gira cwinya yom i can ma aneno pirwu, pien pi arem ma atye kacirone ikoma, atye kamiyo kony me tyeko gin ma orem i can pa Kricito, pi kome, ma en aye jo ma oye en. <verse eid="COL 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 1:25" />Pire omiyo yam adoko latic ma konyo lwak man, pi tic ma Lubanga omiya pirwu, wek amii lok pa Lubanga ongene. <verse eid="COL 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="COL 1:26" />En mung ma okane pi kare malac bot lwak mapol ata, ento kombedi dong Lubanga omiyo onen woko kamaleng bot jone.<verse eid="COL 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="COL 1:27" />Lubanga gire otamo ni emii jone gunge kit ma lonyone me deyo me mung man pire dit kwede ikin Lurok, i mitine kene. Mung meno en ene ni, Kricito bedo i iwu, miyo wubedo ki gen me nywako deyo pa Lubanga. <verse eid="COL 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="COL 1:28" />Wan watucu pi Kricito kun waciko jo ducu, dok bene wapwonyo jo ducu ki ryeko ducu, wek wakel dano acel acel inyim Lubanga madong otegi i Kricito. <verse eid="COL 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="COL 1:29" />Man aye gin ma omiyo ayele matek, kun acuke ki tekone madwong matye katic i iya.<verse eid="COL 1:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="COL 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 2:1" />Amito wunge kit ma acuke kwede katic pirwu, ki pi jo matye i Laodicea, kadi ki jo ducu ma pud peya guneno wanga, <verse eid="COL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 2:2" />wek cwinygi obed tek, dok wek guribe kacel i mar wek gubed ki lonyo ducu ki ngec ducu ma gungeyo mung pa Lubanga ma en Kricito kikome. <verse eid="COL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 2:3" />I en Lubanga okano iye lonyone ducu me ryeko ki ngec. <verse eid="COL 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 2:4" />Awaco man wek ngat mo pe ongakwu ki pyem me gobagoba me bwola. <verse eid="COL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 2:5" />Kadi bed pe atye kacel kwedwu ikom, ento watye kacel i cwiny kun cwinya yom me neno kit ma wuwoto kwede maber i lok ducu, ki niyewu ma ocung matek ikom Kricito.<verse eid="COL 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwo ma opong i Kricito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 2:6" />Kit macalo yam dong wuye Rwot Yecu Kricito, omyero bene wubed i en. <verse eid="COL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 2:7" />Lwitwu omyero odony ocung matek ikome, dok wubed macalo ot ma kigero ikome, ma wucung matek i niyewu kit mayam kipwonyowu kwede, kun pwocwu bene mede ameda.<verse eid="COL 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 2:8" />Wugwoke wek ngat mo pe ongakwu woko ki tam me ryeko nyo me bwola mo ma tere peke, kun wulubu kit yo me tekwaro ki pwony pa jogi maloyo lobo man, ma pe a ki bot Kricito. <verse eid="COL 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 2:9" />Pien Lubanga ikit ma en tye kwede i yo ducu, bedo ikom kricito i cal pa dano. <verse eid="COL 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 2:10" />Wun bene dong kimiyowu kwo ma opong i Kricito. En obedo lawi luloc ki wegi twer ducu. <verse eid="COL 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 2:11" />I Kricito bene dong yam kilirowu woko ki lire mere kikome, pe i lire ma dano gutiyo ki cinggi ikomwu, ento pi kwanyo kit me kom woko ki ikomwu. <verse eid="COL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 2:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 6:4">Rom 6:4</ref> </char></note> Dok ikare ma kibatijawu kiyikowu kacel ki Kricito, ka lacen wucer woko kacel kwede i niyewu ikom tic pa Lubanga matek mayam ocero kwede Yecu Kricito ki ikin jo ma oto. <verse eid="COL 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 2:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:1-5">Epe 2:1-5</ref> </char></note> Wun mayam onongo dong wuto woko pi balwu, ki ni pien pe kiliro ringo komwu, wun aye dong Lubanga omiyo wukwo kacel ki Kricito, kun bene dong oweko balwa woko ducu. <verse eid="COL 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 2:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:15">Epe 2:15</ref> </char></note> En bene yam ongolo banya ducu ma kicoyo iwiwa ki miti me cik ma ceng omiyo kop oloyowa, ocwalo cen ci oguru woko ikom yatariya. <verse eid="COL 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 2:15" />Lubanga dong otyeko loyo jogi woko ma gin luloc ki wegi twer, ci nyutu kamaleng ikare ma Kricito oto ikom yatariya ni dong eloyogi woko.<verse eid="COL 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 2:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 14:1-6">Rom 14:1-6</ref> </char>
    </note> Pimeno, pe wuwek ngat mo ongol kop ikomwu pi lok kom cam nyo ginamata, kadi pi nino madito, nyo por dwe, nyo pi Cabit. <verse eid="COL 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 2:17" />Magi ducu gubedo tipu keken ma nyutu gin ma bibino, ento kom gin meno tye bot Kricito. <verse eid="COL 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 2:18" />Pe wuwek ngat mo ongol ni kop oloyowu, kun mito pire kene ni dano gumwole keken gi gobagoba me woro lumalaika, ma nongo en ocung pi ginanyuta ma en oneno. Kit dano macalo meno wakene mwa labongo tyen lok mo, kun tamo tam me kom keken. <verse eid="COL 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 2:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:16">Epe 4:16</ref> </char></note> En pe omako Kricito matek ma en aye wic, mamiyo dul kom ducu limo cam, dok gikube kacel iwang mwot ki i ler, ka dong cako dongo ikit ma Lubanga mito ni odong kwede.<verse eid="COL 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwo manyen i Kricito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 2:20" />Ka wun yam dong wuto woko kacel ki Kricito, kun dong kigonyowu woko ki ite loc pa jogi me lobo man, pingo pud dok wumede ki bedo calo jo me lobo, kun wugwoko bene cik macalo magi ni, <verse eid="COL 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 2:21" />“Pe imak, pe ibil, pe igudi”? <verse eid="COL 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 2:22" />Magi ducu gubedo cik ki pwony pa dano, ma kemo mere jami ma tum woko ka kitiyo kwedgini. <verse eid="COL 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 2:23" />Ada, cik magi nen calo ryeko tye iye pien nyutu yo me woro ma lamal ma wun wuroto giwu pirwu kenwu, dok pi mwole ken me yelo kom i ciro can, ento pe konyo kadi ki acel me diyo miti me kom.<verse eid="COL 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="COL 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 3:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 110:1">Jab 110:1</ref> </char>
    </note> Kit macalo yam dong wucer woko kacel ki Kricito, wuket cwinywu dong ikom jami matye malo, kama Kricito tye iye i kabedo me deyo inget Lubanga tung acuc. <verse eid="COL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 3:2" />Wuket cwinywu ikom jami matye malo i polo ento pe ikom jami me lobo. <verse eid="COL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 3:3" />Pien yam wuto woko, ento kombedi dong kikano kwowu kacel ki Kricito bot Lubanga. <verse eid="COL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 3:4" />Ka Kricito ma en kwowa binen, wun bene wubinen kacel kwede i deyo.<verse eid="COL 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwo macon ki kwo manyen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 3:5" />Pimeno omyero dong wunek gin ducu me lobo matye i iwu, ma gin aye abor, caro, mit me kom, ki par marac makelo lewic, ki woro me jami marom ki woro jogi. <verse eid="COL 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 3:6" />Akemo pa Lubanga tye kabino pi kit tim macalo meno ikom jo ma pe winyo loke. <verse eid="COL 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 3:7" />I kit kwo mayam wubedo kwede, magi aye gin tim ma onongo wubedo kalubugi. <verse eid="COL 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 3:8" />Ento kombedi omyero dong wubwotgi woko ducu: kiniga, kwar cwiny, rac cwiny, yet, ki loko lok mogo me lewic ma pe omyero kiwiny ka kati ki i dogwu. <verse eid="COL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 3:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:22">Epe 4:22</ref> </char></note> Pe omyero wubwole kekenwu, pien dong wubwoto kwowu macon ca ki tice ducu, <verse eid="COL 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 3:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:24">Epe 4:24</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:26">Aca 1:26</ref> </char></note> ci dong wuruku kwo manyen ma Lubanga tye karocone i ngec manyen me dwokone i cale kikome. <verse eid="COL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 3:11" />Pimeno dong apokapoka pe ikin Lugrik ki Lujudaya, ngat ma kiliro ki ngat ma pe kiliro, larok ma kwiya piny mere ata ma pe ngeyo leb, rok ma pud gudong cen ikit me wi lobo, opii, ki ngat madong lone kene, pien Kricito dong ocoko gin ducu dok bene tye i igi ducu.<verse eid="COL 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 3:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 4:2">Epe 4:2</ref> </char>
    </note> Ento wun aye jo ma Lubanga dong oyero, jo maleng ma Lubanga maro; pimeno omyero dong wuruk cwiny mamiyo wuparo pi can pa luwotwu, wubed ki kica, mwolo, woro ki diyo cwiny. <verse eid="COL 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 3:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:32">Epe 4:32</ref> </char></note> Wudii cwinywu kekenwu, ngat acel acel odii cwinye ikom lawote, kun wutimo kica ki luwotwu ikinwu kekenwu pi balwu. Ka ngat mo ikinwu tye ki lok mo ikom lawote, timo kica pi bal omyero obed tye macalo Rwot bene ceng otimowu kica. <verse eid="COL 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 3:14" />Ento makato magi ducu, omyero wubed kun wupong ki mar. Pien mar keken aye tweyo jami ducu, ribogi kacel ma cobo bene maber licwic. <verse eid="COL 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 3:15" />Wuwek kuc pa Kricito mayam olwongowu ikom acel aye oloo cwinywu, ka wek dong wubed jo mamiyo pwoc kare ducu. <verse eid="COL 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 3:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:19">Epe 5:19</ref>,<ref loc="EPH 5:20">20</ref> </char></note> Wuwek lok pa Kricito obed ma opong i iwu, ka wupwonye, kun wujuke bene kekenwu ki ryeko ducu. Dok bene ka wuwero jabuli, ki wer me pako Lubanga ki wer mogo mukene me dini, wuwer bot Lubanga ki pwoc i cwinywu. <verse eid="COL 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 3:17" />Gin ducu ma wutiyo, kadi ki i lok nyo i tic mogo, wutiigi inying Rwot Yecu, kun wumiyo pwoc bot Lubanga Won kun wok ki bote.<verse eid="COL 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kit me bedo kacel i kwo manyen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 3:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 5:22">Epe 5:22</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 3:1">1 Pet 3:1</ref> </char>
    </note> Wun mon, wumiine kenwu ite loc pa cogwu, pien meno aye gin ma myero ikin jo matye i Rwot. <verse eid="COL 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 3:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:25">Epe 5:25</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 3:7">1 Pet 3:7</ref> </char></note> Wun co bene, wumar monwu, pe wubed ki gero ikomgi. <verse eid="COL 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 3:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:1">Epe 6:1</ref> </char></note> Wun lutino, wuwiny lunyodowu i lok ducu, pien meno aye yomo cwiny Rwot. <verse eid="COL 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 3:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:4">Epe 6:4</ref> </char></note> Wun wego bene, pe myero wunget cwiny lutinowu, miyo cwinygi bale woko. <verse eid="COL 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 3:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:5-8">Epe 6:5-8</ref> </char></note> Wun lutic, myero wuwiny luditowu me lobo man i lok ducu ki cwiny acel, pe i tic ma bwolo wang dano keken, kun wumito wuyom cwiny dano, ento wutii i cwiny me lworo Rwot. <verse eid="COL 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 3:23" />Tic mo keken ma wutiyo, wutii maber ki cwinywu ducu, macalo wutiyo bot Rwot, ento pe pi dano. <verse eid="COL 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 3:24" />Wunge ni wubilimo jami ducu ma Rwot oyubu wa con pi jone macalo mot; pien wun wutye katic pi Rwotwa Kricito. <verse eid="COL 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 3:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 10:17">Nwo 10:17</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 6:9">Epe 6:9</ref> </char></note> Pien latim marac mere kibicule pi gin marac ma en otimo, pien Rwot pe poko kin dano.<verse eid="COL 3:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="COL 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 4:1" />Wun wegi opii, wutii ki opiiwu i yo ma opore, kun wungeyo ni, wun bene laditwu tye malo i polo.<verse eid="COL 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pwony</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 4:2" />Wumede matek ilega ki cwinywu ducu, kun wumiyo pwoc bene. <verse eid="COL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 4:3" />Wuleg pirwa bene, wek Lubanga oyab botwa dogola me tito loke, wek watuc mung pa Kricito, pien pi lok meno aye omiyo koni atye i buc kany, <verse eid="COL 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 4:4" />wek anyut kamaleng ikit ma myero.<verse eid="COL 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 4:5" />Wubed dok wutii ticwu ki ryeko tutwale inyim jo ma pe guye Yecu, kun wutiyo labongo balo kare mo keken. <verse eid="COL 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 4:6" />Lok ma wuloko omyero obed lok mamit ma kado oromo maber, wek wunge kit ma omyero wumii kwede lagam i peny pa ngat acel acel.<verse eid="COL 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mot me agiki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 4:7" />Ominwa Tukiko ma wamaro, ma obedo latic ma gene, dok latic macalo an i Rwot, bitito botwu lok ducu ma dok ikoma. <verse eid="COL 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 4:8" />Acwalo en botwu pi lok man kikome, wek en omii wunge kit ma watye kwede kany, dok bene omyero ocuk cwinywu. <verse eid="COL 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 4:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHM 1:10-12">Pile 10-12</ref> </char></note> Acwale me bino kacel ki ominwa mukene ma wamaro, en aye Onesimo; en bene dano ma gene, dok en oa ki botwu. Gin bitito botwu gin ducu madong otime kany.<verse eid="COL 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 4:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:10: a </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 19:29">Tic 19:29</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 27:2">27:2</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:24">Pile 24</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xo" closed="false">b </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 12:12">Tic 12:12</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 12:25">25</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:13">13:13</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 15:37-39">15:37-39</ref></char>
    </note> Aristako ma lamabuc lawota omotowu, ki Marako okeyo Barnaba mayam dong acikowu pire; ka en oo botwu omyero wujole maber. <verse eid="COL 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 4:11" />Yecu ma nyinge mukene Yucito bene omotowu. Jo magi adeki keken aye gin Lujudaya ma gitiyo tic kacel kwedwa kany i ker pa Lubanga. Gukweyo cwinya tutwal. <verse eid="COL 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 4:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:7">Kol 1:7</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:23">Pile 23</ref></char></note> Epapira latic pa Yecu Kricito ma en ngat acel ma oa ki botwu, bene omotowu. En po pirwu kare ducu i legane matek, wek wubed jo ma otegi, kun wuniang maber i gin ducu ma Lubanga mito ma pe wukalo akala wa ki acel. <verse eid="COL 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 4:13" />An cadene omiyo amoko ni en otiyo tic matek pirwu ki pi jo matye i Laodikia ki Kerapoli. <verse eid="COL 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 4:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:14: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 4:11">2 Tem 4:11</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:24">Pile 24</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 4:10">2 Tem 4:10</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:24">Pile 24</ref> </char></note> Luka ma en daktar ma wamaro, kacel ki Dema bene gumotowu. <verse eid="COL 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 4:15" />Wumot utmego matye i Laodikia, dok wumot Nimpa bene kacel ki jo ma oye Kricito ma gicoke i ode. <verse eid="COL 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 4:16" />Ka dong waraga man kityeko kwanone ikinwu, ci omyero wumii kikwan bene bot jo ma oye Kricito ma gitye i Laodikia, ki wun bene myero wukwan waraga ma jo Laodikia gicwalo botwu. <verse eid="COL 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 4:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHM 1:2">Pile 2</ref> </char></note> Dok wuwac bot Arkipo ni, “Myero inen ni icobo tic madong igamo i Rwot.”<verse eid="COL 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 4:18" />An Paulo acoyo botwu lok me mot man ki cinga. Wupo ikom twec man ma gitweya kwede ki nyor. Kica pa Lubanga obed kwedwu. Amen.<verse eid="COL 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 4" />
</usx>